{"id":"441581","name":"红薯银耳甜汤","author":"緣豆兒","authorId":"8471333","desc":"","cover":"images/441581/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯","amount":"1个"},{"name":"银耳","amount":"15g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"5颗"},{"name":"桂圆肉","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"1块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好材料。","img":"images/441581/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"银耳用清水泡发。","img":"images/441581/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡发的银耳洗净去掉根部发黄发硬的部分，撕成小朵。","img":"images/441581/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"桂圆洗净；红枣去核。","img":"images/441581/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中加水1600ml,放入银耳煮开。","img":"images/441581/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入桂圆和红枣先煮半小时。","img":"images/441581/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"红薯去皮切小块。","img":"images/441581/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中加入红薯再煮半小时。","img":"images/441581/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后加入冰糖，搅拌煮融化就好了。","img":"images/441581/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}